  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FMO is already providing a 5-year mezzanine loan of USD 5 million to enable financial inclusion of the underserved MSMEs. Upon reaching the final close of the Fund, Lendable reached out to FMO to increase its exposure in the fund with an additional USD 5mln so that it can attract some additional investors and reach the targeted size of USD 100 mln.</narrative>
  </description>
